B.Nu=new A.hj("STORM FRONT","Weather over the mast all night. The carrier runs hot and everything arrives faster. OUTPUT x1.5, GAP x0.75.",1.5,1,1,0.75,1,1,1)
B.Nr=new A.hj("SKELETON CREW","Nobody else came in. The rundown was cut to match, but you answer everything alone. QUOTA x0.7, WINDOW x0.85.",1,0.7,0.85,1,1,1,1)
B.No=new A.hj("RATINGS SWEEP","Head office is measuring tonight. Everything counts double and everything costs you more. RP x2.0, DREAD x1.35.",1,1,1,1,2,1.35,1)
B.Nt=new A.hj("A QUIET NIGHT","Long stretches of nothing. You will have time to think, which is worse. GAP x1.4, OUTPUT x0.75, DREAD x1.2.",0.75,1,1,1.4,1,1.2,1)
B.Np=new A.hj("THE ENGINEER'S STANDING BOUNTY","He left money in the drawer for anything you put down. BANISH PAY x2.2, QUOTA x1.25.",1,1.25,1,1,1,1,2.2)
B.Ns=new A.hj("FRESH CORES","The store room was restocked for once. Every answer has room to breathe. WINDOW x1.3, OUTPUT x0.85.",0.85,1,1.3,1,1,1,1)
B.Nq=new A.hj("OPEN LINE","The phones are live and it is not the public calling. GAP x0.7, BANISH PAY x1.6, WINDOW x0.9.",1,1,0.9,0.7,1,1,1.6)
